{"steam_appid":2184020,"steam_name":"LIFTED","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2184020/1664154421/f8e2d2e1be31a96513ea930038fff49f30aeff89/1780178564/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780334171","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257346761/afc655073674f27d756cb658a20e9736e22099b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780334171","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/51419d4c2bf6eea8c2373a5cab75c9a185c20a18/ss_51419d4c2bf6eea8c2373a5cab75c9a185c20a18.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786535913","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/e7ade0c4d17f0cbdf404fe9b18f2b83f723e0eda/ss_e7ade0c4d17f0cbdf404fe9b18f2b83f723e0eda.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786535913","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/ca5541cabea14976b273699606d2664872a02052/ss_ca5541cabea14976b273699606d2664872a02052.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786535913","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/3aefdec97226ebce5bc22df913dad088af5bf3e2/ss_3aefdec97226ebce5bc22df913dad088af5bf3e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786535913","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/a35c16c9c6ef6b090ee5019a8f6a1921ef369db9/ss_a35c16c9c6ef6b090ee5019a8f6a1921ef369db9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786535913"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/fa6df0d7e2407bb363aea0444afd0187.webp?t=1786535913\" alt=\"Start the Heist Today\" width=449 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ari just wanted extra credit. Instead, he became the accidental wingman in a time-traveling heist to help his physics professor woo the history teacher.<strong> Perfect for Controllers and Steam Deck!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/781619e3d5da0668a35ebc819e8c98f5.poster.avif?t=1786535913\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/781619e3d5da0668a35ebc819e8c98f5.webm?t=1786535913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/781619e3d5da0668a35ebc819e8c98f5.mp4?t=1786535913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/539604a604277f400d9ef99bd06b5762.webp?t=1786535913\" alt=\"Explorer. Puzzle. Escape.\" width=449 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LIFTED</i></strong> channels the spirit of classic adventure games, mixing wholesome platforming with high-stakes discovery. Follow clues to find the lost Tiara, solve environmental puzzles, and master fluid movement. Professor Raventhorpe provides the &quot;Vision&quot; while you provide the manual labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/2f55f47d4ca94ebdf8683c9ac7ebdfac.avif?t=1786535913\" width=500 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But keep your head on a swivel. When the villains show up (or an avalanche starts), the pace explodes. The only way out is <i>through</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/16b109d43099a2597ea98042e00628e9.webp?t=1786535913\" alt=\"The Floors are Years\" width=449 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/45d3a5fb685792d7d9e873e434dfbef6.poster.avif?t=1786535913\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/45d3a5fb685792d7d9e873e434dfbef6.webm?t=1786535913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/45d3a5fb685792d7d9e873e434dfbef6.mp4?t=1786535913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professor Raventhorpe’s &quot;Anytime Elevator&quot; hurtles you through both time AND space. In this machine, the floor numbers map to history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the button for Floor 1712, align the map to the Caribbean, and you arrive in the Year 1712. Right in the middle of pirate-infested Tortuga! But watch out: while the Elevator gets the <i>time</i> right, it rarely lands exactly <i>where</i> you expected. Prof. R is still working out the kinks...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/48e71d6c25086dc7bdaa5bf2485f1b47.poster.avif?t=1786535913\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/48e71d6c25086dc7bdaa5bf2485f1b47.webm?t=1786535913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/48e71d6c25086dc7bdaa5bf2485f1b47.mp4?t=1786535913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story full of heart, humor, and 80s movie magic featuring top-tier voice acting from Joe Gaudet as Ari, Ray O'Hare as Professor Raventhorpe, and Evan Widjaja as Julius.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Slacker:</strong> Ari just wants to go home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Genius:</strong> Professor Raventhorpe will do anything for love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chinchilla:</strong> Julius is the only one who knows what he's doing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/c6e259cba5c08fea4791e5976fa9aa93.webp?t=1786535913\" alt=\"A Blockbuster Buddy-Comedy\" width=450 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for stopping by! If you have a few minutes, give the FREE DEMO a try and experience the beginning of Ari’s adventure today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/aed48e3a03b2067ba03457c1cd01fe2c.avif?t=1786535913\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/fbebaf3e2537adb06cedb2b42b6d0b55.avif?t=1786535913\" width=450 height=94 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 22H2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-9600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Adventure Works L.L.C."],"publishers":["Adventure Works L.L.C."],"release_date":"Jul 22, 2026"}